# The exported word media, ~470 MB of webp and ogg. It is a derived artifact --
# `data/releases/<export>/{img,audio}` is the source of truth, and repopulating it is
# the two-line rsync in content_media/README.md. release.db itself stays tracked: it is
# 4.7 MB, the unit tests read it directly, and without it the app has no content at all.
content_media/src/main/assets/content_media/img/
content_media/src/main/assets/content_media/audio/
